<title>UK: TABLE-TBI year pretax profit soars 89 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-TBI year pretax profit soars 89 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		4.22		   vs 3.57</p>
<p> Final dividend (pence) 1.50		   vs N/A</p>
<p> Pretax		     19.1		   vs 10.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   95.8		   vs 35.4</p>
<p>NOTE - TBI said airport operations contributed up to 10.5 million stg to operating profits versus 5.1 million stg as a result of acquisitions.</p>
<p>TBI raised its final dividend by 50 percent versus the previous year. It planned to pay an interim dividend in future years.</p>
<p>Full company name - TBI Plc. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
